How Modern Paint Protection Film Works
Precision Cutting: Digital design software cuts the multi-layer film to match your exact vehicle panel dimensions.
Adhesive Bonding: A clear, paint-safe acrylic adhesive forms a permanent bond with the factory clear coat.
Impact Absorption: The elastomeric polyurethane core absorbs impact energy from stone chips, gravel, and light scrapes.
Hydrophobic Shielding: A specialized top coat repels environmental contaminants, chemical stains, UV rays, and water.
